{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-001","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Man’s faith in God is measured by his confidence in himself.","primary_topic":"SELF_CONCEPT","secondary_topics":["FAITH_PRAYER"],"tags":["confidence","faith","self-concept"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-002","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Decreeing is ever done in consciousness.","primary_topic":"CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM","secondary_topics":["ASSUMPTION"],"tags":["consciousness","decree","assumption"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-003","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Every man automatically expresses that which he is conscious of being.","primary_topic":"CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM","secondary_topics":["SELF_CONCEPT"],"tags":["consciousness","expression","being"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-004","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"The law of consciousness is the only law of expression.","primary_topic":"CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM","secondary_topics":[],"tags":["consciousness","expression","law"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-005","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Consciousness is the way as well as the power which resurrects and expresses all that man will ever be conscious of being.","primary_topic":"CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM","secondary_topics":["SPIRITUAL"],"tags":["consciousness","expression","being"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-006","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"To rise in consciousness to the level of the thing desired and to remain there until such level becomes your nature is the way of all seeming miracles.","primary_topic":"ASSUMPTION","secondary_topics":["STATES","CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["state","naturalness","desire"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-007","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Rebirth is the dropping of that level with which you are dissatisfied and rising to that level of consciousness which you desire to express and possess.","primary_topic":"STATES","secondary_topics":["SELF_CONCEPT"],"tags":["rebirth","state-change","consciousness"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-008","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Taking your attention from one state and placing it upon the other, you die to the one from which you have taken it and you live and express the one with which you are united.","primary_topic":"ATTENTION","secondary_topics":["STATES"],"tags":["attention","state-change","focus"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-009","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"We can be to others only that which we are to ourselves.","primary_topic":"SELF_CONCEPT","secondary_topics":["RELATIONSHIPS"],"tags":["self-concept","relationships","identity"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-010","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"No man can lift you to the level you desire. The power to ascend is within yourself; it is your consciousness.","primary_topic":"CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM","secondary_topics":["SELF_CONCEPT"],"tags":["consciousness","self-reliance","state"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-011","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"You and your conception of yourself are one.","primary_topic":"SELF_CONCEPT","secondary_topics":[],"tags":["self-concept","identity"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-012","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"You are and always will be greater than any conception you will ever have of yourself.","primary_topic":"SELF_CONCEPT","secondary_topics":["CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["self-concept","identity","potential"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-013","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Your present level of consciousness will only be transcended as you drop the present state and rise to a higher level.","primary_topic":"STATES","secondary_topics":["CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["state-change","consciousness","transcend"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-014","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"You rise to a higher level of consciousness by taking your attention away from your present limitations and placing it upon that which you desire to be.","primary_topic":"ATTENTION","secondary_topics":["STATES","SELF_CONCEPT"],"tags":["attention","limitations","desired-state"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-015","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Expressions follow the impressions, they do not precede them.","primary_topic":"ASSUMPTION","secondary_topics":["CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["impression","expression","assumption"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-016","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Consciousness precedes all manifestations and is the prop upon which all manifestation rests.","primary_topic":"CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM","secondary_topics":["REALITY_CIRCUMSTANCES"],"tags":["consciousness","manifestation","cause"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-017","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Stop looking for signs. Signs follow; they do not precede.","primary_topic":"ASSUMPTION","secondary_topics":["FAITH_PRAYER"],"tags":["signs","faith","assumption"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-018","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Your world is your consciousness objectified. Waste no time trying to change the outside; change the within or the impression; and the without or expression will take care of itself.","primary_topic":"REALITY_CIRCUMSTANCES","secondary_topics":["CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["world","consciousness","inner-change"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-019","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Consciousness is the door through which life reveals itself.","primary_topic":"CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM","secondary_topics":[],"tags":["consciousness","door","life"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-020","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"To express the qualities of a consciousness naturally, you must dwell or live within that consciousness. Appropriate it by becoming one with it.","primary_topic":"STATES","secondary_topics":["CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["state","naturalness","dwelling"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-021","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"This rebirth Jesus referred to when he said to Nicodemus, “Ye must be born again” [John 3:7], was nothing more than moving from one state of consciousness to another.","primary_topic":"STATES","secondary_topics":["SPIRITUAL"],"tags":["rebirth","state-change","consciousness"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-022","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"In short, man’s conception of himself determines that which he sees his world to be.","primary_topic":"SELF_CONCEPT","secondary_topics":["REALITY_CIRCUMSTANCES"],"tags":["self-concept","world","perception"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-023","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"It is not the words that make it effective; it is the consciousness of being the thing which makes it effective.","primary_topic":"ASSUMPTION","secondary_topics":["CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["words","being","assumption"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-024","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Change your conception of yourself and you will automatically change the world in which you live. Do not try to change people; they are only messengers telling you who you are. Revalue yourself and they will confirm the change.","primary_topic":"SELF_CONCEPT","secondary_topics":["RELATIONSHIPS","REALITY_CIRCUMSTANCES"],"tags":["self-concept","people","change"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-025","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Assume the consciousness of that which you desire to express. Claim it until it becomes a natural manifestation. Feel it and live within that feeling until you make it your nature.","primary_topic":"ASSUMPTION","secondary_topics":["FEELING","STATES"],"tags":["assumption","feeling","naturalness"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-026","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Here is a simple formula. Take your attention from your present conception of yourself and place it on that ideal of yours, the ideal you had heretofore thought beyond your reach.","primary_topic":"ATTENTION","secondary_topics":["SELF_CONCEPT"],"tags":["attention","ideal","self-concept"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-027","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"As you wear a feeling, it becomes your nature.","primary_topic":"FEELING","secondary_topics":["STATES"],"tags":["feeling","nature","state"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-028","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Man is warned to be selective in that which he hears and accepts as true.","primary_topic":"ATTENTION","secondary_topics":["INNER_CONVERSATION"],"tags":["hearing","attention","selection"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-029","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"There is a vast difference between feeling a thing and merely knowing it intellectually.","primary_topic":"FEELING","secondary_topics":["ASSUMPTION"],"tags":["feeling","knowing","experience"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-030","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"You cannot force anything outwardly by the mightiest effort of the will. There is only one way you can command the things you want and that is by assuming the consciousness of the things desired.","primary_topic":"ASSUMPTION","secondary_topics":["CONSCIOUSNESS_I_AM"],"tags":["will","assumption","consciousness"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-031","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Only as one is willing to give up his present limitations and identity can he become that which he desires to be.","primary_topic":"SELF_CONCEPT","secondary_topics":["STATES"],"tags":["limitations","identity","state-change"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-032","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Praying, then, is recognizing yourself to be that which you desire to be rather than begging God for that which you desire.","primary_topic":"FAITH_PRAYER","secondary_topics":["ASSUMPTION","SELF_CONCEPT"],"tags":["prayer","recognition","desired-state"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-033","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"The man who has called this disciple into being knows that every desire of his heart is a gift from heaven and that it contains both the power and the plan of its self-expression.","primary_topic":"DESIRE","secondary_topics":["SPIRITUAL"],"tags":["desire","gift","self-expression"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-034","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"This quality of denial – when disciplined – protects man from receiving impressions that are not in harmony with his nature. He adopts an attitude of total indifference to all suggestions that are foreign to that which he desires to express. Disciplined denial is not a fight or a struggle but total indifference.","primary_topic":"ATTENTION","secondary_topics":["FEAR_DOUBT"],"tags":["denial","attention","indifference"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
{"quote_id":"YFIYF-CUR-035","corpus_id":"B002","author":"Neville Goddard","source_title":"Your Faith Is Your Fortune","source_year":1941,"source_slug":"your_faith_is_your_fortune","source_section":"Canonical book","quote_original":"Stand still in the psychological state defined as your objective until you feel the thrill of Victory.","primary_topic":"ASSUMPTION","secondary_topics":["STATES","FEELING"],"tags":["state","persistence","feeling"],"editorial_decision":"SELECT","review_mode":"SOURCE_FIRST_CANONICAL","source_file":"master_text_your_faith_is_your_fortune.txt","review_policy":"EDITORIAL_POLICY.md"}
